{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "小津じゃーん！！⚔️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202608/mobjlkthK.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんにちは！こんばんは！\n小津玲奈です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "少し時間が経ってしまいましたが\n宮城公演ありがとうございました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "東北に行くこと自体が初めてだったので\n今回宮城県で公演をさせていただけて\nとても嬉しかったです！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "噂には聞いていましたが\n牛タンチケットも本当に存在しており！？\n美味しい牛タンをたくさん頂きました🐮"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本当に人生で1番美味しい牛タンだったの！\n思い出しただけでもお腹が空いてきちゃった"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202608/mobKi8ApL.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "さらにさらに\n人生で初めてずんだシェイクを飲みました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "小津のずんだ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "名付けておづんだ！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202608/mobl7iOyl.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ずんだって枝豆なんだって！\n知らなかったからとってもびっくりしたの"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "枝豆をすりつぶして作られ、\n豆を打つ、つまり\n「豆ん打」から「ずんだ」なのだそう"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "枝豆の無限の可能性を感じたよ🫛"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "さてさて\n宮城といえば、忘れちゃいけないのが\n伊達政宗ですね！？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お久しぶりなれいな博士！\n豆知識をお願いします！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202608/mobyXDWgZ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "伊達政宗はスペイン王国やローマ教皇庁との\n外交関係を築くために、\n慶長遣欧使節団を派遣しました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そうそう\n伊達政宗率いる軍隊が派手な格好をしていたため\n「粋でかっこいい格好をした男性」のことを\n伊達男というようになったのだそう。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "伊達巻も派手な卵焼きだから「伊達」とつくんだとか（諸説あり）"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "先見の明もありオシャレさんでもあった\n伊達政宗"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "さすが\n独眼竜といわれるだけあって\nかっこいいエピソードが多いですね⚔️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "サボりがちなれいな博士にも\n伊達政宗の敏腕さを真似してもらいたいです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "牛タン、笹かまぼこ、ずんだ、、、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "美味しいご飯もたくさんあって\n幸せな宮城公演でした"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜひまた行きたいです！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーー"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "れいな博士\n牛タンを食べすぎて\n胃がいずいんだそうです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いずいの使い方\nあってますか？？😊\n皆さん判定をお願いします！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日から始まる福岡公演も\nよろしくお願いします！"}], "source": "official"}